<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#BatteryMetalScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Battery metals subject to recycled content declaration, Art. 8(1)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#BatteryMetalScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#Cobalt> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#BatteryMetalScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#Lead> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#BatteryMetalScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#Lithium> .
