<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#Lead> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Not to be confused with batchem:Pb, the lead-acid CELL CHEMISTRY of battery-chemistries. This concept is the METAL whose recycled content is declared. Different namespaces, different meanings."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#Lead> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-metals#BatteryMetalScheme> .
